# AEGIS runtime secrets. Installed as /etc/aegis/aegis.env (root:aegis, 0640).
# Read by systemd (EnvironmentFile=) and sourced by aegis-spacetrack, so keep
# plain KEY='value' lines. Single-quote values; a password containing a single
# quote will not parse the same way in both, so change it if it has one.
# Never commit a filled-in copy of this file.
SPACETRACK_USER=''
SPACETRACK_PASS=''
